PREMIUM  DFHMDF POS=(7,20),LENGTH=9,ATTRB=(UNPROT)                      00000120
ERRMSG   DFHMDF POS=(23,1),LENGTH=70,ATTRB=(PROT,BRT)   error line      00000130
         DFHMSD TYPE=FINAL
         END
